> What about weapons?

Grandmaster martial arts averages 9.25 damage per hit.  Unless you're
doing conducts, weapons are a good thing since they can be enchanted
up.

EG: A +5 regular long sword does more damage than grandmaster martial
arts!  Heck, if you're only worried about damage against large
creatures, a +3 long sword will do the trick.

Decent artifacts do more, sometimes much more--even something like
Snickersnee or Vorpy at +7 is a rather sizeable upgrade over martial
arts, and if you get Grayswandir or Fire/Frost Brand so much the better!



